#  FILTER OVERVIEW
#========================================
#  [00000] Custom Rules
#  [10000] Alpha
#    [11000] Alpha Alpha - Core Items Core
#  [20000] Beta
#    [21000] Beta Beta - Classy Classy
#    [22000] Beta Beta - Decorated Decorated
